### Ping
GET http://localhost:7071/healthz

### Ingest a song
POST http://localhost:7071/ingest/song-ended
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId":"a75a3a53-533a-4ced-90c8-dd569ce8ba04",
  "username":"demo_user",
  "userId":"user-demo-123",
  "artist":"DJ Shadow",
  "title":"Midnight in a Perfect World",
  "album":"Endtroducing.....",
  "year":1996,
  "genre":"abstract / trip hop",
  "provider":"hang.fm",
  "eventId":"evt-abc-123"
}

### Latest facts
GET http://localhost:7071/api/facts/latest

### By artist
GET http://localhost:7071/api/facts/by-artist?name=DJ%20Shadow

### Recent plays
GET http://localhost:7071/api/plays/recent?limit=5

### Genres
GET http://localhost:7071/api/genres
